 event admission is required.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lsu-tiger-rag-touchdown-chant","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Tiger Rag Touchdown Chant","title":"Spell Out Tigers After the Score","subtitle":"The band-and-crowd response to an LSU touchdown","notes":"After an LSU touchdown, listen for Tiger Band’s motif and join the spelled-out response from your seat without entering restricted areas.","short_summary":"A short band cue converts each LSU touchdown into a collective spelling lesson.","evidence_claim":"LSU Athletics documents that after a Tigers touchdown, the band plays the “Tiger Rag” motif and fans respond by spelling out “T-I-G-E-R-S.”","source_url":"https://lsusports.net/gameday-soundtrack-geico","source_title":"Gameday Soundtrack","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This score-triggered ritual occurs inside Tiger Stadium during football games; event admission is required.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lsu-home-white-football-jerseys","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"LSU Home White Jerseys","title":"Look for White on the Home Side","subtitle":"LSU football’s inverted home-uniform convention","notes":"At a home game, photograph the team’s white jerseys from your assigned area and compare the combination with LSU’s documented uniform history.","short_summary":"LSU’s home team often wears the color normally associated with visiting football teams.","evidence_claim":"LSU Athletics traces its home-white-jersey tradition to the 1958 national-championship season and says the practice returned in 1995 after a rules change.","source_url":"https://lsusports.net/news/2007/12/18/1354158","source_title":"Football to Wear Traditional White Jerseys in BCS Game","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2007-12-17","source_fetch