.lsu.edu/student-affairs/lsu-ring.php","source_title":"LSU Ring","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Participation is limited by LSU Ring eligibility, purchase, ordering deadlines, and current ceremony instructions.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lsu-tiger-twelve-recognition","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Tiger Twelve","title":"Recognize Twelve Graduating Tigers","subtitle":"LSU’s annual senior honor built around scholarship, leadership, and service","notes":"Read the current eligibility rules, nominate an eligible senior by the posted deadline, or follow LSU’s announcement of the new class.","short_summary":"Each spring, LSU distills a graduating class into twelve examples of campus and community contribution.","evidence_claim":"LSU Student Affairs states that each spring it recognizes 12 outstanding seniors who contribute positively to campus, the surrounding community, or society.","source_url":"https://www.lsu.edu/student-affairs/tiger-twelve/index.php","source_title":"Tiger Twelve","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Applications and nominations are limited to published eligibility windows; viewing the recipient page is public.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
